*! cleanplots14v v1.1.0 Trenton Mize 2026-10-12
*! Ordinal companion scheme to cleanplots: 14 sequential viridis colors
*
* Inherits the primary cleanplots scheme via #include. Overrides colors
* in Stata's 15 plot slots, while retaining independent line patterns
* and marker symbols. Ordered categories run from light yellow to dark purple.
*
* Color source: viridis (van der Walt & Smith 2015), sampled at end=.95 and direction=-1.
* Matching R scale:
*   scale_color_viridis_d(option = "viridis", end = 0.95, direction = -1)
*
* Colors recycle after 14 series when there are more than 14 plots.
* The 15 plot styles retain their own line patterns and marker symbols.
* Bar/area fills inherit cleanplots' 70 percent intensity.
*
* Example: graph bar price, over(rep78) asyvars scheme(cleanplots14v)

#include cleanplots

color p1              "222 227 24"
color p1line          "222 227 24"
color p1lineplot      "222 227 24"
color p1markline      "222 227 24"
color p1bar           "222 227 24"
color p1barline       "222 227 24"
color p1area          "222 227 24"
color p1arealine      "222 227 24"
color p1pie           "222 227 24"
linepattern p1line solid
linepattern p1lineplot solid
symbol p1 smcircle

color p2              "172 220 49"
color p2line          "172 220 49"
color p2lineplot      "172 220 49"
color p2markline      "172 220 49"
color p2bar           "172 220 49"
color p2barline       "172 220 49"
color p2area          "172 220 49"
color p2arealine      "172 220 49"
color p2pie           "172 220 49"
linepattern p2line dash
linepattern p2lineplot dash
symbol p2 smsquare

color p3              "124 210 80"
color p3line          "124 210 80"
color p3lineplot      "124 210 80"
color p3markline      "124 210 80"
color p3bar           "124 210 80"
color p3barline       "124 210 80"
color p3area          "124 210 80"
color p3arealine      "124 210 80"
color p3pie           "124 210 80"
linepattern p3line shortdash
linepattern p3lineplot shortdash
symbol p3 smtriangle

color p4              "83 197 105"
color p4line          "83 197 105"
color p4lineplot      "83 197 105"
color p4markline      "83 197 105"
color p4bar           "83 197 105"
color p4barline       "83 197 105"
color p4area          "83 197 105"
color p4arealine      "83 197 105"
color p4pie           "83 197 105"
linepattern p4line longdash
linepattern p4lineplot longdash
symbol p4 smdiamond

